					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13755835#post-4780833</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13755835/groups-of-interest-jp#post-4780833</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2020 15:50:58 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Dc_Yerko</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1780049</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Koigarezaki Simbun is a really nice idea. I love the concept of a news network of anomalous events in the paranormal society. I would have loved to have had this idea first, but my mind is not that creative. There's a lot of other GoIs here with really nice ideas too, probably Kisaragi being my second most favourite here in concept.</p> <p>I would like to use some of these GoIs on ES, my main-branch, but I don't think I can localize them outside of Japan correctly. Anyways, very nice concepts for GoIs, the Japanese Branch is undoubtedly one of the most creative and interesting we have. Never stop growing, please!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
